  "strings": {
    "Deal. Show me what your dragons can do.": "說定了。讓我看看你的龍有多厲害。",
    "Face Teana's fairies in an optional village duel.": "在村莊的額外決鬥中挑戰緹安娜的天使族牌組。",
    "Festival of Light": "光之慶典",
    "My turn. A quiet deck can still surprise you.": "輪到我了。安靜的牌組也會帶來驚喜。",
    "One More Duel": "再來一場",
    "One more round before the lanterns go out?": "燈籠熄滅前，再來一局如何？",
    "Return to Jono's table for a friendly rematch.": "回到喬諾的桌前，來一場友好的再戰。",
    "Then let the lanterns be our audience.": "那就讓燈籠為我們觀戰吧。",
    "Well played. Next time, I will have another surprise ready.": "打得不錯。下次，我會準備另一個驚喜。",
    "You win tonight. But keep a seat for me at the next festival!": "今晚你贏了。不過，下次慶典別忘了給我留個座位！",
    "mission/forbidden-memories/fm-jono-rematch/description": "回到喬諾的桌前，來一場友好的再戰。",
